'''Mystery Mask''' is a [[Treasure]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. Even though it is the last [[Treasure]] set in the menu, it is not the last the player can complete - that honor goes to the [[Neutrino]]. It reduces the 1100% strength magnifications applied to the final boss of its respective CotC Chapter by up to 1000%, making it almost essential for the final fight, as otherwise the bosses' already high stats can compound with further boosts, resulting in further trouble. Enemy stats shown on this wiki are with '''completed''' Mystery Masks.

==Effect==
When a player has activated a [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter's Mystery Mask, the boss of [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]] will be weakened by up to 1000% (additively). For example, [[The Cat God|Chapter 1's final boss]] has 1,399,999 health and 53,997 attack power, but the default stat magnification applied to his base stats without the Mystery Mask is +1,000% upon his initial 100% strength magnification, making him 1,100%, with a health and attack power of 15,399,989 and 593,967 respectively.

The Mystery Mask from any one chapter '''DOESN'T''' affect the final bosses in the other two chapters.

