==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the description was "A strange effect will activate when Ch.X is cleared!"
**This description was misleading, as clearing a chapter has no special effects even when it is active. This appears to be the result of a mistranslation: its Japanese description (宇宙編X章最終ステージで効果を発揮する謎のお面) more closely translates to "A mysterious mask that displays an effect in the final stage of [[Cats of the Cosmos|Cosmos]] Chapter X."
*The blue hair around the mask is clearly [[The Cat God (Special Cat)|Cat God]]'s hair.
*In spite of being listed 11th and last place in the Treasure Menu, the Mystery Mask is actually the 10th obtainable Cats of the Cosmos Treasure.
*The Mystery Mask bears a slight resemblance to the golden face above [[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Thunder God Zeus]].

